      "uid": "zhcn:3916a308bd65b18b2b6fcd21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌从樱花千代王和目白阿尔丹口中\n得知两人伤势复原的状况。\n不过，她们不知何时才能够复出……",
      "source_fingerprint": "48735fc1e18a743164b5b473613cb7eddeaf5bca173844144c47f0d173dcfcdb",
