    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f898191e7fcfa12761027c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人不安地表示会不会已经没人记得自己。\n八重无敌发誓会继续奔跑，\n守护两人的容身之处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f89c4f255bb8242290414e4d3771b4462c9d68a4f24c4527dbd651c2cefe791e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
