    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e78bddbdcf34287224cb8966",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌和训练员一起来看“有马纪念”。\n小栗帽获胜后，\n观众们都大力称赞她是世代代表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6073b0eef11a369fb46ef56929d4e7e9646728c4314e315d00ae5c3ba82ea277",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072436.json",
      "json_path": [
