    {
      "uid": "zhcn:062b34325641b44018eb16cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌对没有人提起自己和劲敌们的\n名字这点感到气愤不已，认为曾在经典三冠中\n奋战过的她们才能够代表这个世代。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99cb6b10283fa85858077a9e253fd94b3c4dd321e751b688edc61c053ec2cf83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072436.json",
      "json_path": [
