      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然这样就只能赢过小栗帽了，\n如此才能证明是她们在背负这个世代。\n这就是八重无敌展现的“执着”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32204177082b983cd3f4eb2270db2dcf8f8986c9f3808f1fa8841e3dcf304349",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
