    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426b30883db964c989f257d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌跑出了满意的表现！\n她靠“执着”燃起斗争心，\n完美地达到“火水合一”的境界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f634bcb0d2cf22bf241b7cc0d16ded0dcbe299b204b9ece260ebd6a942735c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
