    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a85cd6913bbcc1232da9de0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过她还是没能改变观众的评价。\n虽然有人认同八重无敌的表现，\n但大部分人们仍认为小栗帽实力较强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c13bd7c419a1bc976c6b91cae3e79d43b9eb10afa92ffe2d8a8801998965a1e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
