    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d174e4c1c3df27da94b888",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌确信果然还是\n必须战胜小栗帽才行。\n而现在的她也有自信能赢过对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "852b6248336ba50321793297db7b9c117beae18c15d01c5c8d65d5da0f0ac162",
