    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3112534405c371fff01d7bce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌和训练员\n决定下一个目标是“安田纪念”。\n他们要和小栗帽正面对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c15ce6f8b6e38f8596be8fca01b3a6596270fc614156a3b03de27160576329a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
