    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b01a36c92284c7fba6a16e93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌询问训练员。\n为什么就算自己跑出最好的表现，\n依然无法赢过小栗帽？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8cb0513ad78d71393ef91d4d16d3be392db30e7687bea48a9a1524b69888456",
