    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fd4864f605858dea5e0c95a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过检讨后，两人推测小栗帽能够\n将观众的声援转化为自己的力量。\n若真是如此，她今后只会越变越强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7208d0238a61dadfd4866de96b8b2289bcb8c0bffcaa19d00737120612791ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
